From: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 23 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: airoha: re-trigger JCPLL VCO band search on AN7581 ETH lane

On the AN7581 ETH SerDes lane (10G lan2 on the Gemtek W1700K, feeding an
RTL8261N PHY over USXGMII), the JCPLL VCO band search is only performed
once, from an7581_pcs_jcpll_bringup(), which programs JCPLL_VCO_TCLVAR
*before* the "Enable PLL" / "Enable PLL Output" writes at the end of the
same function. The field is never written again afterwards, and the
driver never verifies JCPLL/TXPLL lock.

Because the band search runs while the PLL is still off, it can settle on
a VCO code whose transmit the RTL8261N system-side SerDes cannot lock onto
(SoC TX -> PHY RX): the PHY's system SerDes shows no block lock and the
USXGMII in-band AN word never completes, so the lane links down forever.
On at least one board this reproduces 100% of the time (0/100 link-ups
across ip link and driver unbind/rebind cycles); it is also the likely
cause of the "lan2 only comes up on some boots" reports, where the
one-shot band search occasionally lands on a usable code.

The fix is to re-run the band search once the PLL is enabled and the lane
is fully configured. A TCLVAR *transition* with the PLL running re-triggers
the search; the final value is not what matters (both 0x3 and 0x5 work) -
only that the field changes while the PLL is up. This must happen after the
whole config sequence (bringup + airoha_pcs_init + the USXGMII AN enable),
so it is added as a post_config op called at the end of airoha_pcs_config()
and wired into an7581_pcs_eth only (USXGMII/10GBASER), leaving the PON lane
untouched.

Root cause and confirmation on a live, unpatched device (ETH-lane
pcs_ana + 0x30, TCLVAR = bits [2:0]):

  devmem 0x1fa7a030            # 0x0000301B, dead lane
  devmem 0x1fa7a030 32 0x0000301D   # link comes up within ~1-2s

Verified on one board only; needs wider confirmation, hence the devmem
one-liner above. Does NOT touch the PON/WAN lane (an7581_pcs_pon).

Signed-off-by: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha.h
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha.h
@@ -1683,6 +1683,8 @@
 		       int index, phy_interface_t interface);
 	void (*link_up)(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv, int index);
 	int (*rxlock_workaround)(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv, int index);
+	void (*post_config)(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv,
+			    int index, phy_interface_t interface);
 };

 #define to_airoha_pcs_port(n) container_of(n, struct airoha_pcs_port, pcs)
@@ -1697,6 +1699,8 @@

 void an7581_pcs_phya_link_up(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv, int index);
 int an7581_pcs_rxlock_workaround(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv, int index);
+void an7581_pcs_jcpll_recal(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv,
+			    int index, phy_interface_t interface);
 #else
 static inline int an7581_pcs_alloc_regmap_fields(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv)
 {
@@ -1730,6 +1734,12 @@
 {
 	return 0;
 }
+
+static inline void an7581_pcs_jcpll_recal(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv,
+					  int index,
+					  phy_interface_t interface)
+{
+}
 #endif

 #ifdef CONFIG_PCS_AIROHA_AN7583
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
@@ -1906,6 +1906,23 @@
 	return 0;
 }

+void an7581_pcs_jcpll_recal(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv,
+			    int index, phy_interface_t interface)
+{
+	struct regmap_field **pcs_ana_fields = priv->pcs_ana_fields[index];
+
+	if (interface != PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_USXGMII &&
+	    interface != PHY_INTERFACE_MODE_10GBASER)
+		return;
+
+	/* Re-trigger the JCPLL VCO band search now that the PLL is enabled
+	 * and the lane is fully configured; a TCLVAR transition with the PLL
+	 * running settles the band on a code the RTL8261N can lock onto. */
+	regmap_field_write(pcs_ana_fields[AN7581_PCS_JCPLL_VCO_TCLVAR], 0x3);
+	usleep_range(1000, 2000);
+	regmap_field_write(pcs_ana_fields[AN7581_PCS_JCPLL_VCO_TCLVAR], 0x5);
+}
+
 static void an7581_pcs_pll_bringup(struct airoha_pcs_priv *priv,
 				   int index, phy_interface_t interface)
 {
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
@@ -704,6 +704,9 @@
 				AIROHA_PCS_XFI_TX_FC_EN | AIROHA_PCS_XFI_RX_FC_EN :
 				0);

+	if (data->post_config)
+		data->post_config(priv, index, interface);
+
 	return 0;
 }

@@ -1394,6 +1397,7 @@
 	.bringup = an7581_pcs_bringup,
 	.link_up = an7581_pcs_phya_link_up,
 	.rxlock_workaround = an7581_pcs_rxlock_workaround,
+	.post_config = an7581_pcs_jcpll_recal,
 };

 static const struct airoha_pcs_match_data an7581_pcs_pon = {
